WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.535
-The game works
exactly like Pictionary,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.836
except the person who is drawing

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.271
will be wearing one of these
virtual-reality headsets,

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.273
and they're drawing
in a 3-D space

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:11.277
using a program called
Tilt Brush.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.612
We will be able to see
their point of view

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:14.880
on the big screen upstage.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.750
You get 45 seconds per turn.
I will go first.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.985
You guys can all
take your seats.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:19.919
You can sit there, bud.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.254
-Whew.
-Alright, here we go.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.255
Kristen, are you good
at Pictionary?

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:26.392
-I'm such a bad drawer.
-Perfect, uh, alright, good.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:29.362
Okay, oh, wait, I need to do
something first, right?

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.565
Alright, give me --
give me a number.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.500
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.269
One guy just said three.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.105
Here we go.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:44.043
Okay, alright.

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:47.313
Okay.
Alright, so, it's a person.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.247
How's that?

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.083
-What...

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.518
-What's going on?

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:54.220
-Woman, maybe.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.789
-Oh, my God.

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:58.024
-The devil!

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.859
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:01.193
Um...

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:03.529
-What?
-Hands.

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:07.533
-I don't ever want
to meet this person.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.702
Is it Donkey from "Shrek"?

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.404
-I'm like, "Is it me?"

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.239
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.875
-What?

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.009
-He's just saying "Ooh?"

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:18.244
-Yeah, kind of.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.846
-Ooh.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:22.348
Wait.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.184
-Ooh?
-"Oh?"

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:26.786
-He's saying...

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:31.124
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.992
Kristen, I need a guess,
anything at all.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.194
-[ Laughter ]
[ Sour note plays ]

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:36.328
-It's a werewolf.

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:38.431
-I'm awful at this.
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.899
-What is it?

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.067
-It's supposed to be a werewolf.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:41.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.269
-Oh, that was --
see, that was --

00:01:44.269 --> 00:01:46.138
You did a great job.
I did not.

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:47.206
-Thank you.
Thank you, I appreciate it.

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:48.407
-Yeah, I have a one-track mind.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:49.942
I'm like, "The Devil.
The Devil. The Devil."

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:51.511
-Gaten, you're up.
-Ahh.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.146
-Gaten, you're up.
-I'm nervous.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.581
-No, don't be nervous.
-I might pee.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.015
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.717
-I already did, so you got
to think of something original.

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:00.019
-I have a large head.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.922
-Oh, before you put that on,
Gaten, pick a number.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:03.890
-It's light.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.458
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.060
Nine's my -- nine is my lucky
number.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.061
-I like nine.

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:10.763
-Nine is my lucky number.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:11.997
I don't know why.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:15.501
-Is it your birthday or
something?

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.970
-No.
-Oh.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.004
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.172
-Yep.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.940
-Okay, no, that's not bad.
That's not bad.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.575
-Good luck.
-No.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.842
-You got this.

00:02:23.842 --> 00:02:25.612
-Sorry, dude, alright.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.712
-Sorry, man.

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:28.480
Alright, here we go.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.283
-Okie dokie.
Okay, can I start?

00:02:31.283 --> 00:02:32.451
Yeah, I can start? Okay.

00:02:32.451 --> 00:02:33.853
-Go.
-Oh, it's an object.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.621
It's, like, an object,
so you know.

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:39.492
-Okay.
-Okay, and then...

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:40.492
-Oh...

00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:44.897
-Wait, wait, not done yet.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.469
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:53.139
Tariq, how come
you're not guessing?

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:54.039
-Um...

00:02:54.039 --> 00:02:56.141
Okay, it's, um, uh...

00:02:56.141 --> 00:03:00.212
Is it, like, oh, my God, a
termite thing?

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:01.447
-What? No!

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.281
No.

00:03:02.281 --> 00:03:04.851
I don't know what else to do.

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:05.818
-Walk around it.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:06.653
-An ant farm.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:08.388
-Make it three-dimensional.

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:10.122
-An ant farm. A hamster wheel.
-Yeah!

00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:12.091
[ Bell dings ]

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:16.829
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:17.730
-What?!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.564
-Yeah!

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:19.432
-We do this!

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:20.733
-How did they get that?

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:21.867
-We do this!

00:03:21.867 --> 00:03:22.968
-How did you get that?

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:24.237
-No idea how he got that.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.138
-That is insane --
a termite in a hamster wheel.

00:03:26.138 --> 00:03:27.973
-The synergy, man.
Synergy, bro. Come on.

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:30.310
-Alright you're up.
Kristen, you're up.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.378
-There's nowhere to go
from here but up.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.679
-For sure.

00:03:33.679 --> 00:03:38.751
-I just want to say --
"werewolf" is not a person.

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.119
-[ Laughs ]
-You know what I mean?

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.420
I was like...
-I agree with you.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.322
-Alright.
-It's like a character.

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.723
-Mythical figure.
-Yeah.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.157
-Oh, man.

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:46.292
-Werewolf.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.394
-Cool, so I drew an action.
That's fun.

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:51.631
I'm gonna draw this action.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.265
-Drawing this action's
gonna be really fun.

00:03:53.265 --> 00:03:54.567
-I'm gonna look so cool doing
it, too, ready?

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:55.668
-You look so --
-Here we go.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:56.869
-You look cool
doing anything, bud.

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:57.870
-Okay, so it's...

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.205
-It's an action, okay.

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.873
It's a person.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.375
They have a hand.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:05.945
They're waving.
They're giving out tickets.

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:06.946
Candy bars.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:08.147
They are chopping something.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:11.083
They are -- that can't be --
that can't be it.

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.151
What is happening?

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.652
-Wait, wait.

00:04:13.652 --> 00:04:16.088
-Alright, they're happy.

00:04:16.088 --> 00:04:17.356
A beard.

00:04:17.356 --> 00:04:19.191
They have a beard, and they're
holding something.

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:20.760
A candy bar, a microphone.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.528
Is it Santa Claus?

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:23.763
-[ Groans ]

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.598
-Is it paper?

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.667
"1, 2, 3," on it.
-Uh, actually, it's both.

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.368
-It's a numbers runner.
-No, wait, it's --

00:04:29.368 --> 00:04:33.406
-Oh, okay, no, it's a teacher.
A teacher with an eraser.

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:36.041
A teacher with a --
with a-a-a-- ice cream.

00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:37.643
A-A Klondike bar.

00:04:37.643 --> 00:04:39.311
It's a bearded teacher!

00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:42.581
Is it, uh, Bill from, uh --
uh, what's that game?

00:04:42.581 --> 00:04:43.716
[ Sour note plays ]

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:44.650
-Oh, gosh.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.451
-Do we win by default?

00:04:46.451 --> 00:04:47.920
-I just started cheating.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.056
-It was an action.
What was it?

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:51.891
-A selfie, you know what I mean?

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.392
-Ah, man.
-Wow.

00:04:53.392 --> 00:04:54.961
-That was good.
That was good. I'm sorry.

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.429
-Okay, okay.

00:04:57.429 --> 00:04:58.797
I mean,
do I even need to get up?

00:04:58.797 --> 00:05:01.300
I mean, I feel like --
I feel like we won regardless.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.635
-But here's the thing, Tariq.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:06.238
You think you won, but
I just heard from the booth.

00:05:06.238 --> 00:05:08.340
This final round
is worth 1,000 points.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.442
-Oh, come on.

00:05:09.442 --> 00:05:10.877
-Whoever wins this
wins the whole game.

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:12.010
-Okay.

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:12.845
-Alright, so here's
the way it works --

00:05:12.845 --> 00:05:14.179
-So, wait, if I lose, you win?

00:05:14.179 --> 00:05:15.948
-That's correct.
That's the way it is.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:18.484
-Why?
-That's just the way life works.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:21.754
Gaten, you have to grow up
sometime, buddy. I'm sorry.

00:05:21.754 --> 00:05:23.256
-He's all grown up.

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:25.892
-So, Tariq, you're gonna do it,
but we're all gonna guess.

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:26.725
-Oh.
-Okay.

00:05:26.725 --> 00:05:27.693
-So whoever guesses wins.

00:05:27.693 --> 00:05:29.528
-Oh.
-Okay, cool, sweet.

00:05:29.528 --> 00:05:30.696
-Okay.
-Alright, what number?

00:05:30.696 --> 00:05:32.031
-Uh, I'm going, mm...

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:33.465
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:05:33.465 --> 00:05:35.467
One. I'm going one.
I'm going one.

00:05:35.467 --> 00:05:36.902
-Here you go. Good luck.

00:05:36.902 --> 00:05:39.037
-Mm. Mm!

00:05:39.037 --> 00:05:41.874
This is...

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:43.643
-Come on. We got this.
We can still get the win.

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:45.344
-...a movie.
-Do you guys know what it is?

00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:46.545
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.545 --> 00:05:47.747
'Cause I heard, like, "Oh..."

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:49.248
-Yeah.

00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:50.616
Is it an action?
What is it, Tariq?

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:53.051
-It's a person in a film.
-Oh.

00:05:53.051 --> 00:05:54.220
-Got to pull the trigger, Tariq,
and start drawing.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.788
-Shut up.

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:57.390
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.426
-Oh, it's an oval.
It's a potato.

00:06:00.426 --> 00:06:01.593
It's not a potato.

00:06:01.593 --> 00:06:02.694
-That's an angry man.

00:06:02.694 --> 00:06:03.829
-A vampire -- Dracula.

00:06:03.829 --> 00:06:06.031
-That's, uh, Frankenstein?

00:06:06.031 --> 00:06:07.766
It's, uh -- what?

00:06:07.766 --> 00:06:08.968
