-A ghost!

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.269
It's Casper -- isn't that --

00:06:10.269 --> 00:06:11.170
-Oh, a lot of hair.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.672
-Oh, Beetlejuice?
-The Joker?

00:06:13.672 --> 00:06:14.540
-Is it Rick
from "Rick and Morty"?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:15.541
