-Ah! Yes!

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:17.176
[ Bell dinging ]

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:19.812
-Was it?

00:06:19.812 --> 00:06:20.913
No, what did you say?
What is it?

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:21.914
-Joker?

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:23.348
We got it -- Joker!
-No!

00:06:23.348 --> 00:06:27.019
-I love it! Kristen Stewart --
the best, my partner.

00:06:27.019 --> 00:06:28.687
